step	1	5	A strange dream
line	<col=000080>After drinking from a strange bottle I'm dreaming. A <col=800000>crab</col> on the beach wants to become a ceremonial leader, but he needs an instrument.</col>
line	<col=000080>He wants me to bring him the <col=800000>shells</col> scattered around the island.</col>
step	2	25	An instrument
line	<str>After drinking from a strange bottle I'm dreaming. A crab on the beach wants to become a ceremonial leader, but he needs an instrument.</str>
line	<str>He wants me to bring him the shells scattered around the island.</str>
line	<col=000080>None of the shells were right. The crab wants a <col=800000>string instrument</col>. I should use the <col=800000>big fishing net</col> on the <col=800000>flotsam</col> and put together what I find.</col>
step	3	45	Ceremonial leaders
line	<str>After drinking from a strange bottle I'm dreaming. A crab on the beach wants to become a ceremonial leader, but he needs an instrument.</str>
line	<str>He wants me to bring him the shells scattered around the island.</str>
line	<str>None of the shells were right. The crab wants a string instrument. I should use the big fishing net on the flotsam and put together what I find.</str>
line	<col=000080>I gave the crab his instrument. Now he needs other <col=800000>ceremonial leaders</col>. I should investigate the trees and bushes on the island for crabs. If one is too scared to come out I could <col=800000>sit down</col> beside it for a while.</col>
step	4	50	More leaders
line	<str>After drinking from a strange bottle I'm dreaming. A crab on the beach wants to become a ceremonial leader, but he needs an instrument.</str>
line	<str>He wants me to bring him the shells scattered around the island.</str>
line	<str>None of the shells were right. The crab wants a string instrument. I should use the big fishing net on the flotsam and put together what I find.</str>
line	<str>I gave the crab his instrument. Now he needs other ceremonial leaders. I should investigate the trees and bushes on the island for crabs. If one is too scared to come out I could sit down beside it for a while.</str>
line	<col=000080>Six crabs have joined the practice. There are still more hiding around the island.</col>
